Z||000003||Majik||06-20-2000||03:44 PM||||tgowens:  I have reviewed your page...and it is great.  I think your poker run pictures made me the most jealous   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  Its not every day that I get to see more than 2 Fiero's together!  Great work on the layout of those pictures too!  Thanks!||||reg||1
Z||000004||tgowens||06-22-2000||02:47 AM||||Thanks for the compliments Majik --  I have fun with graphics and web design and certainly have fun with the Fiero -- and it IS great to see them all lined up that way -- there are some in those pictures that made me drool!! Good luck to you down there and if I can be of any help feel free to email me..... <A HREF="mailto:terry@tgowens.com">terry@tgowens.com</A> ||||reg||1
Z||000005||2M4 Dale||06-23-2000||03:31 AM||||I've been trying to the same...Lots and Lots of Fieros around my town. I've just been droping flyers on cars. We have went from two members to about eight , I think. The trouble is getting guys who want to do stuff together. I've actually had much better luck with getting the guys from this Forum to participate in a couple of local events. Even though they are from much farther away. GOOD LUCK and if you find out any secrets let me know !!!||||reg||14
Z||000006||Majik||06-23-2000||04:17 AM||||Thanks guys.  I guess what I'm asking is...the fliers that you hand out, what sort of information is on them?  Basic meeting info?  Stuff like that.<P>Web page update:  Layout and grafix are done!  Its daymn hot looking...so keep your eyes peeled.  Will be a tad empty at first, but its like a house, you grow into it! <P>Again thanks, and cheers!<P>Todd||||reg||1
Z||000007||2M4 Dale||06-23-2000||10:54 AM||||My flyers just have our Club Logo on them and my phone number and email address. And a little invitation to become a member of  Ashland-Mansfield Fiero Club.||||reg||1
